"Allows you to select a document and convert its colors to a new color space, "
"like RGBA, CMYKA or L*a*b."
msgstr ""
"Omogoča izbiro dokumenta in pretvorbo njegovih barv v nov barvni prostor, "
"kot so RGBA, CMYKA ali L*a*b."

